# My app

Started from the Stack Junkie Style showcase with the {{presetLabel}} preset.

```sh
npm install
npm run dev
npm run build
```

- `@stack-junkie/ui-web` installs from the library file attached to the `{{tag}}` release of {{repository}}. To move to another version, change both version numbers in that URL in `package.json`.
- `src/App.tsx` holds the preset and the choices changed from it.
- `npm run build` fails while any Stub remains and names where each one is.
